| !Subwin: freeglut's subwin demo: a window with nested subwindows. Keys typed go
| to the (sub)window under the pointer.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set Subwin$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Subwin$Output /|<Subwin$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !Subwin needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !Subwin needs ARMEABISupport
Run <Subwin$Dir>.!RunImage
